[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187529315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118119#issuecomment-4187529315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118119","id":4187529315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc75mKBj","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-04T18:18:42Z","updated_at":"2026-04-04T18:18:42Z","body":"Haven't found any related issue/PR suggesting if this was intended or not, so treating it as a regression bug until clarification.\n\nAlso please provide a MRP to facilitate testing. For regressions this makes it much easier to find the root cause and fix it quickly.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4187529315/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4264130314","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118119#issuecomment-4264130314","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118119","id":4264130314,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-KXcK","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T23:33:48Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T23:48:36Z","body":"I can't reproduce this on 4.7.dev f94bbfc07 (Linux + NVIDIA), nor on 4.6.1.stable, 4.5.1.stable or 4.4.1.stable.\n\nDouble-check you are using Forward+, as SSS is only supported in that renderer, not Mobile or Compatibility.\n\nLeft = StandardMaterial3D, Right = ShaderMaterial converted from StandardMaterial3D:\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e3bfc94e-439a-4468-a2f0-3ca6c9a8ee5d\" />\n\nSSS off for comparison:\n\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7108a5c4-002c-481c-ac92-fb4b7a9ef29b\" />\n\n**Testing project:** [test_subsurf.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26803767/test_subsurf.zip)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4264130314/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4272545201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118119#issuecomment-4272545201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118119","id":4272545201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7-qd2x","user":{"login":"GianOM","id":109994362,"node_id":"U_kgDOBo5heg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109994362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM","html_url":"https://github.com/GianOM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GianOM/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-18T03:22:05Z","updated_at":"2026-04-18T03:35:35Z","body":"I figure it out:\n\nWhenever you set the ALPHA to 1.0 and the SSS_STRENGTH = 1.0, Godot turns off the Subsurface Scattering Effect (see image below)\n\n<img width=\"1272\" height=\"973\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d8f3812-dcf3-4870-8fe8-4eaf46f685af\" />\n\n\n\n\nHowever, if I don't set the ALPHA, the effect turns ON again (image below)\n\n\n\n\n<img width=\"1272\" height=\"973\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/64875337-d115-442b-9193-d3439717b53d\" />\n\n\nApparently this is the default behavior in Godot.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4272545201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]